Input: {"question": "Which educational institution did George H. Hess attend?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 37, "text": "Title: The Unlikely Path of George H."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 38, "end": 74, "text": "Hess: A Journey of Medical Discovery"}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 76, "end": 251, "text": "In the quaint town of Stockton, California, a private university stood tall, its reputation for academic excellence and innovative thinking drawing students from far and wide."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 252, "end": 414, "text": "The University of the Pacific, founded in 1851, had established itself as a beacon of knowledge, fostering a community of curious minds and ambitious individuals."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 415, "end": 457, "text": "Among them was a young man named George H."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 458, "end": 538, "text": "Hess, whose life's trajectory would forever be intertwined with the institution."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 539, "end": 616, "text": "Born with an insatiable curiosity and a passion for the human body, George H."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 617, "end": 657, "text": "Hess was destined to become a physician."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 658, "end": 753, "text": "Growing up, he was fascinated by the intricacies of human anatomy and the mysteries of disease."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 754, "end": 875, "text": "As he navigated the complexities of his teenage years, George's resolve to pursue a career in medicine only strengthened."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 876, "end": 992, "text": "The University of the Pacific, with its esteemed medical program, became the obvious choice for the aspiring doctor."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 993, "end": 1022, "text": "In the early 1900s, George H."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1023, "end": 1175, "text": "Hess enrolled at the University of the Pacific, embarking on a journey that would shape his future and leave an indelible mark on the medical community."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1176, "end": 1349, "text": "The university's rigorous curriculum, coupled with its emphasis on hands-on learning, provided George with the ideal environment to hone his skills and expand his knowledge."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1350, "end": 1515, "text": "Under the guidance of esteemed professors, George delved into the world of medicine, immersing himself in the study of human physiology, pharmacology, and pathology."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1516, "end": 1718, "text": "He spent countless hours in the university's state-of-the-art laboratories, conducting experiments and analyzing data, driven by an insatiable thirst for understanding the intricacies of the human body."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1719, "end": 1845, "text": "As George progressed through his studies, he became increasingly fascinated by the rapidly evolving field of medical research."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1846, "end": 2096, "text": "The University of the Pacific's strong ties to the medical community and its emphasis on interdisciplinary collaboration provided George with opportunities to engage with renowned researchers and clinicians, further fueling his passion for discovery."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2097, "end": 2248, "text": "One such opportunity arose when George was invited to participate in a groundbreaking research project focused on the treatment of infectious diseases."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2249, "end": 2276, "text": "Under the mentorship of Dr."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2277, "end": 2492, "text": "Emma Taylor, a pioneering researcher in the field, George contributed significantly to the project, demonstrating a keen understanding of the complex relationships between microorganisms and the human immune system."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2493, "end": 2652, "text": "The University of the Pacific's commitment to fostering a culture of innovation and collaboration played a pivotal role in George's development as a physician."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 30, "text": "**Renowned Physician George H."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 31, "end": 86, "text": "Hess Reflects on Formative Years at Aarhus University**"}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 88, "end": 136, "text": "Aarhus, Denmark - In an exclusive interview, Dr."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 137, "end": 146, "text": "George H."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 147, "end": 287, "text": "Hess, a leading figure in the medical community, shared with us the pivotal role Aarhus University played in shaping his illustrious career."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 288, "end": 291, "text": "Dr."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 292, "end": 447, "text": "Hess, a distinguished physician with over three decades of experience, credits his alma mater, Aarhus University, for laying the foundation of his success."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 448, "end": 537, "text": "\"My time at Aarhus University was instrumental in fostering my passion for medicine,\" Dr."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 538, "end": 554, "text": "Hess reminisced."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 555, "end": 693, "text": "\"The university's emphasis on interdisciplinary collaboration and cutting-edge research created an environment that allowed me to thrive.\""}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 694, "end": 737, "text": "During his tenure at Aarhus University, Dr."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 738, "end": 844, "text": "Hess was particularly drawn to the institution's strong programs in biomedical sciences and public health."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 845, "end": 1000, "text": "\"The faculty's dedication to mentoring and the university's state-of-the-art facilities provided me with a solid foundation in the sciences,\" he explained."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1001, "end": 1017, "text": "According to Dr."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1018, "end": 1189, "text": "Hess, his experience at Aarhus University not only equipped him with the necessary skills to excel in his field but also instilled in him a sense of social responsibility."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1190, "end": 1293, "text": "\"The university's commitment to addressing global health challenges resonated deeply with me,\" he said."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1294, "end": 1384, "text": "\"It inspired me to pursue a career that would make a meaningful impact on people's lives.\""}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1385, "end": 1388, "text": "Dr."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1389, "end": 1492, "text": "Hess's achievements are a testament to the university's reputation for producing exceptional graduates."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1493, "end": 1711, "text": "Since graduating, he has gone on to publish numerous papers in esteemed medical journals, receive prestigious awards for his contributions to the field, and hold leadership positions in prominent medical organizations."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1712, "end": 1752, "text": "Aarhus University's Vice-Chancellor, Dr."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1753, "end": 1781, "text": "Anne-Mette Hvas, praised Dr."}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1782, "end": 1846, "text": "Hess's accomplishments, stating, \"We are incredibly proud of Dr."}, "D2S24": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1847, "end": 1927, "text": "Hess's achievements and the positive impact he has had on the medical community."}, "D2S25": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1928, "end": 2092, "text": "His success is a reflection of the university's commitment to providing students with a world-class education and fostering a culture of innovation and excellence.\""}, "D2S26": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2093, "end": 2137, "text": "Data from Aarhus University reveals that Dr."}, "D2S27": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2138, "end": 2199, "text": "Hess is not an isolated example of the institution's success."}, "D2S28": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2200, "end": 2408, "text": "According to the university's latest statistics, 90% of its medical graduates go on to pursue successful careers in their field, with many becoming leading experts in their respective areas of specialization."}, "D2S29": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2409, "end": 2415, "text": "As Dr."}, "D2S30": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2416, "end": 2521, "text": "Hess looks back on his journey, he remains grateful for the opportunities Aarhus University provided him."}, "D2S31": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2522, "end": 2593, "text": "\"My experience at Aarhus University was truly transformative,\" he said."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id"